0..56 Comment "//! `submit-reap` sends a read and reaps its completion."
57..60 Comment "//!"
61..138 Comment "//! A mock ring owes one completion for its submission. The pathological twin"
139..213 Comment "//! refuses a submitted read with a pending completion as `LinearResidue`."
214..217 Comment "//!"
218..294 Comment "//! The checker gives the submitter a pending completion after its send. The"
295..344 Comment "//! mock kernel posts `done` and closes the ring."
345..348 Comment "//!"
349..412 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/completion/pending-dropped.gandr"
